<http://data.silknow.org/object/15250491-87ca-383b-ac30-1db30c738744>
        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Suzani (cover or hanging), silk embroidered with silk in floral pattern, lined with industrially printed cotton, probably Uzbekistan, 19th century; Textiles; Embroidery"@en , "Cover of embroidered yellow silk rep cloth and probably with a cotton weft. Embroidered with silk in shades of blue, pink, magenta, cream, buff and mauve in chain and a little stem stitch. The field and the border on all four sides have identical patterns of scattered floral sprays. The lining, of printed cotton, has a pattern of pine forms and flowers in red and green."@en ;
        ecrm:P138i_has_representation  <http://data.silknow.org/image/189723a5-f39c-3d36-a772-5547183f6052> , <http://data.silknow.org/image/5036012f-c29e-372c-9bc3-31246bade63a> , <http://data.silknow.org/image/77f4d126-cb77-3428-9e96-7383ac830afc> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note               "Cover of embroidered yellow silk rep cloth and probably with a cotton weft. Embroidered with silk in shades of blue, pink, magenta, cream, buff and mauve in chain and a little stem stitch. The field and the border on all four sides have identical patterns of scattered floral sprays. The lining, of printed cotton, has a pattern of pine forms and flowers in red and green."@en , "Suzani (cover or hanging), silk embroidered with silk in floral pattern, lined with industrially printed cotton, probably Uzbekistan, 19th century; Textiles; Embroidery"@en ;
